e53d0ddc3d4bde51END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4338ebf292263f41END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_JaheirasHouse_MinscComeback</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_JaheirasHouse_MinscComeback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_JaheirasHouse_MinscComeback\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">86f9ed87-4623-4da1-8e53-ec59cb2ba827</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:86f9ed87-4623-4da1-8e53-ec59cb2ba827\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:86f9ed87-4623-4da1-8e53-ec59cb2ba827\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-227&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-27</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A faded cutting from the city circular, Baldur's Mouth.]\n</p><p><br>\n<b>BELOVED RANGER BEWITCHED!</b>\n</p><p><i>Citizens of the city were stunned to find a local landmark absent when the sun rose over the Wide this morning. \n</i></p><p><i>The Beloved Ranger, a statue dedicated to a <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">hero of the city</a>, was removed from its perch overnight, with reports of a struggle and sounds of battle during the dark hours. \n</i></p><p><i>The city watch had no comment to add, but the market square told a clear tale of smashed cobblestones, scorched tiling, and blood-speckled stalls. Whatever force wrested the ranger from his perch, he did not go quietly.</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212629\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.082 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25613/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7227/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931346/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.771      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   66.771      1 -total\n 52.58%   35.109      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.98%   30.701     15 Template:Trim\n 25.37%   16.940      2 Template:Uid\n 15.50%   10.348      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.12%    8.095      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.05%    6.712      1 Template:Notes\n  9.77%    6.526      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.36%    6.249      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31684-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714212629 and revision id 396688. Rendering was t